@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam DefaultFontSize 15
mainframe sd ValidateAndAppendCsv
participant ":ImportCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "<<class>>\nCsvAddressBookImporter" as Importer STORAGE_COLOR
participant "model:Model" as Model MODEL_COLOR
[-> Command : execute(model)
activate Command
note over Command : Resolve the source path with FileUtil.
Command -> Importer : read(resolvedPath)
activate Importer
note over Importer
Validate the header, CSV syntax
and every member before returning.
An error stops this flow before mutation.
end note
Importer --> Command : candidates
deactivate Importer
Command -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Command : complete roster
note over Command
Compare against stored members and
previously accepted rows using isSamePerson().
end note
loop each unique candidate
Command -> Model : addPerson(candidate)
end
Command -> Model : updateFilteredPersonList(SHOW_ALL)
Command -> Model : setNameSorting(false)
Command -->[ : CommandResult(imported, skipped)
deactivate Command
@enduml
